---@alias kubernetes.scheduling.IoK8sApiSchedulingV1alpha3CompositePodGroupTemplatePodGroupTemplatesList kubernetes.scheduling.IoK8sApiSchedulingV1alpha3PodGroupTemplate[]

---DisruptionMode defines how individual entities within a group can be disrupted. Exactly one mode can be set.
